<title>BELGIUM: EU finmins welcome Portugal EMU convergence plan.</title>
<headline>EU finmins welcome Portugal EMU convergence plan.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union finance ministers welcomed on Monday Portugal's economic convergence programme to qualify for the European single currency, a diplomat said.</p>
<p>&quot;The plan was overwhelmingly applauded,&quot; the diplomat said.</p>
<p>The Portuguese plan updates the forecast on budget deficit, debt, inflation and other economic indicators up to 2000.</p>
</text>
